{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Storm\u2014 born of wild thunder and old legends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your father, Amadeus, was more than a stallion \u2014 he was a symbol of freedom. A leader. A protector. Under his guidance, a herd unlike any other flourished on a living island that pulsed with nature\u2019s rhythms. Meadows rolled for miles, rivers sang, and no hoof fell without purpose. Horses of every color and kind ran as one, their spirits untamed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/238c3dc6ba0b53115ea48f58a0e0e2a9.poster.avif?t=1765397363\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/238c3dc6ba0b53115ea48f58a0e0e2a9.webm?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/238c3dc6ba0b53115ea48f58a0e0e2a9.mp4?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But peace never lasts forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans came \u2014 not as friends, but as takers. Greedy, frightened by what they could not control. They brought machines and iron traps. They cut forests, built fences, and turned freedom into profit. One by one, the herd was scattered, captured, broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amadeus fought until the end. In a desperate act of defiance, he entrusted his legacy to his children \u2014 his foals \u2014 hiding each in a different corner of the island. One in the searing desert, where winds carve stone like water. Another in the frostbitten peaks, chained near frozen waterfalls. One among the trees where silence reigns, and one trapped in farmland, surrounded by barns and the scent of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each sibling carries a spark of Amadeus\u2019 spirit \u2014 but each has forgotten what it means to run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you, Storm, are no longer a colt. The blood of the wild roars in your veins. The call of the herd echoes in your dreams. It\u2019s time to reclaim your legacy \u2014 to rescue your siblings, rebuild what was lost, and challenge the grip of human domination over your kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is not a tale of revenge \u2014 it's a journey of hope, healing, and balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/bda9879e982e2d5198554b71457c84c0.poster.avif?t=1765397363\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/bda9879e982e2d5198554b71457c84c0.webm?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/bda9879e982e2d5198554b71457c84c0.mp4?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because not all humans are enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some still carry memories of gentleness. Children who whisper to the wind. Elders who once rode bareback beside your ancestors. Rebels who live on the margins, seeking their own kind of freedom. Help them, and they may help you. Heal the island \u2014 not just from the fences, but from the fear that built them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face more than physical obstacles. You\u2019ll face doubt. Loss. The temptation to run alone. But true strength isn\u2019t just in speed or muscle \u2014 it\u2019s in remembering who you are, and why you run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through storm and shadow. Leap broken fences. Outwit hunters. Find your siblings. Teach them to believe again. And when the herd runs once more, let the island tremble beneath the sound of your hooves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.poster.avif?t=1765397363\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.webm?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.mp4?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Storm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The island waits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom is your birthright \u2014 and your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/e7a61f6e106a490dc96ed81606e13a7e.poster.avif?t=1765397363\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/e7a61f6e106a490dc96ed81606e13a7e.webm?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/e7a61f6e106a490dc96ed81606e13a7e.mp4?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826170?t=1765397363","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/90212a27c680ec4ff0adf4fafc064859796b132b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765397363","capsule_image":"https:/