p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some still carry memories of gentleness. Children who whisper to the wind. Elders who once rode bareback beside your ancestors. Rebels who live on the margins, seeking their own kind of freedom. Help them, and they may help you. Heal the island \u2014 not just from the fences, but from the fear that built them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face more than physical obstacles. You\u2019ll face doubt. Loss. The temptation to run alone. But true strength isn\u2019t just in speed or muscle \u2014 it\u2019s in remembering who you are, and why you run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through storm and shadow. Leap broken fences. Outwit hunters. Find your siblings. Teach them to believe again. And when the herd runs once more, let the island tremble beneath the sound of your hooves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.poster.avif?t=1765397363\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.webm?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.mp4?t=1765397363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Storm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The island waits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom is your birthright \u2014 and your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/e7a61f6e106a490dc96ed81606e13a7e.poster.avif?t=1765397363\" 